注意 / Note

本仓库**不包含** Eagle 应用或其浏览器扩展的任何代码。
`patches/` 下的脚本只包含补丁逻辑，运行时需要你自己机器上已安装的 Eagle 扩展作为输入。

This repository does **NOT** contain any code from the Eagle app or its browser
extensions. The scripts under `patches/` contain only our own patch logic; they
require the Eagle extension already installed on your own machine as input.
